{"version":2,"exportedAt":1772845921524,"story":{"title":"Sir Reginald and Bumble","userPrompt":"A brave knight and lazy donkey","authorStyleId":"beverly-cleary","readingLevel":"growing","illustrationStyleId":"colored_pencil","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Sir Reginald was a brave knight. He had shiny armor and a big, strong sword. But Sir Reginald had a secret. He wasn't very good at riding horses. He always bounced too much! So, he had Bumble, a donkey. Bumble wasn't very fast.","illustrationPrompt":"Sir Reginald, a young knight with a slightly worried face, stands next to Bumble, a fluffy, gray donkey looking sleepy. They are in a sunny meadow. Reginald's armor is shiny, but a little dented. Bumble has wildflowers woven into his mane. Bright, cheerful colors. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772633721955,"durationMs":7064,"retries":0,"promptLength":1200,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A Young adult, early 20s with fair skin with a light blush on his cheeks, with short sandy blonde hair in short and neatly combed, slightly messy from his helmet, average bright blue eyes with confident, proud expression, wearing Shiny silver armor with a red cross emblem on his chest. He wears a blue tunic underneath his armor. His helmet has a small red feather on top., with Silver sword with a jeweled hilt and Brown leather belt, Slightly buck teeth, Freckles across his nose, A small scratch on his left cheek, Dimples when he smiles. A medium light grey fur with a darker grey mane and tail donkey, small dark brown eyes with calm, docile expression, wearing Simple brown saddle and bridle., with None, Large, floppy ears, A small patch of white fur on his forehead, Slightly overgrown hooves, A noticeable swayback, chubby build. Sir Reginald stands beside Bumble, showcasing his shiny armor and sword. Bumble stands patiently. in Medieval Kingdom Countryside, near a stable or castle grounds.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"One day, the King asked for a brave knight to find the Singing Flower. It was said to make everyone happy. Sir Reginald knew he had to try. He patted Bumble. \"We're going on an adventure!\" he said.","illustrationPrompt":"Sir Reginald, looking determined, stands before the King in a grand hall. The King has a kind face and a sparkly crown. Bumble peeks in from behind Sir Reginald, looking curious. Warm, inviting colors. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772633720633,"durationMs":5738,"retries":0,"promptLength":1216,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A Young adult, early 20s with fair skin with a light blush on his cheeks, with short sandy blonde hair in short and neatly combed, slightly messy from his helmet, average bright blue eyes with determined, excited expression, wearing Shiny silver armor with a red cross emblem on his chest. He wears a blue tunic underneath his armor. His helmet has a small red feather on top., with Silver sword with a jeweled hilt and Brown leather belt, Slightly buck teeth, Freckles across his nose, A small scratch on his left cheek, Dimples when he smiles. A medium light grey fur with a darker grey mane and tail donkey, small dark brown eyes with unenthusiastic, resigned expression, wearing Simple brown saddle and bridle., with None, Large, floppy ears, A small patch of white fur on his forehead, Slightly overgrown hooves, A noticeable swayback, chubby build. Sir Reginald pats Bumble on the head, looking determined. The King's castle is visible in the background. in Medieval Kingdom Countryside, near the castle entrance.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"Bumble sighed. He liked naps more than adventures. He shuffled his feet. Sir Reginald climbed on. They started down the road. Bumble walked very, very slowly. \"Come on, Bumble!\" Sir Reginald urged.","illustrationPrompt":"Sir Reginald sits on Bumble, who is walking very slowly down a dirt road. Sir Reginald is pointing forward, looking eager. Bumble looks grumpy. The road is lined with trees and flowers. Bright, happy colors. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772633722113,"durationMs":7217,"retries":0,"promptLength":1194,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A Young adult, early 20s with fair skin with a light blush on his cheeks, with short sandy blonde hair in short and neatly combed, slightly messy from his helmet, average bright blue eyes with impatient, encouraging expression, wearing Shiny silver armor with a red cross emblem on his chest. He wears a blue tunic underneath his armor. His helmet has a small red feather on top., with Silver sword with a jeweled hilt and Brown leather belt, Slightly buck teeth, Freckles across his nose, A small scratch on his left cheek, Dimples when he smiles. A medium light grey fur with a darker grey mane and tail donkey, small dark brown eyes with reluctant, tired expression, wearing Simple brown saddle and bridle., with None, Large, floppy ears, A small patch of white fur on his forehead, Slightly overgrown hooves, A noticeable swayback, chubby build. Sir Reginald is on Bumble's back, urging him forward. Bumble shuffles his feet, looking reluctant. in Medieval Kingdom Countryside, on a dirt road.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":4,"text":"They came to a small hill. Bumble stopped. \"I'm tired,\" he brayed. Sir Reginald sighed. He knew Bumble wasn't being difficult on purpose. He was just a lazy donkey. Sir Reginald jumped off.","illustrationPrompt":"Sir Reginald stands next to Bumble at the bottom of a small, grassy hill. Bumble has his head down, looking tired. Sir Reginald has his hands on his hips, looking thoughtful. Soft, pastel colors. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772633727474,"durationMs":6841,"retries":0,"promptLength":1210,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A Young adult, early 20s with fair skin with a light blush on his cheeks, with short sandy blonde hair in short and neatly combed, slightly messy from his helmet, average bright blue eyes with frustrated, understanding expression, wearing Shiny silver armor with a red cross emblem on his chest. He wears a blue tunic underneath his armor. His helmet has a small red feather on top., with Silver sword with a jeweled hilt and Brown leather belt, Slightly buck teeth, Freckles across his nose, A small scratch on his left cheek, Dimples when he smiles. A medium light grey fur with a darker grey mane and tail donkey, small dark brown eyes with exhausted, stubborn expression, wearing Simple brown saddle and bridle., with None, Large, floppy ears, A small patch of white fur on his forehead, Slightly overgrown hooves, A noticeable swayback, chubby build. Bumble stands still, looking tired, near a small hill. Sir Reginald sighs, standing beside him. in Medieval Kingdom Countryside, at the base of a small hill.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"\"Okay, Bumble,\" he said. \"Let's walk up together!\" Sir Reginald started pushing Bumble from behind. It was slow work. But Bumble started to feel a little better. He puffed and panted.","illustrationPrompt":"Sir Reginald is pushing Bumble up the hill from behind. Bumble is panting, but starting to smile a little. The sun is shining brightly. Warm, cheerful colors. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772633729453,"durationMs":7498,"retries":0,"promptLength":1205,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A Young adult, early 20s with fair skin with a light blush on his cheeks, with short sandy blonde hair in short and neatly combed, slightly messy from his helmet, average bright blue eyes with helpful, determined expression, wearing Shiny silver armor with a red cross emblem on his chest. He wears a blue tunic underneath his armor. His helmet has a small red feather on top., with Silver sword with a jeweled hilt and Brown leather belt, Slightly buck teeth, Freckles across his nose, A small scratch on his left cheek, Dimples when he smiles. A medium light grey fur with a darker grey mane and tail donkey, small dark brown eyes with straining, slightly more willing expression, wearing Simple brown saddle and bridle., with None, Large, floppy ears, A small patch of white fur on his forehead, Slightly overgrown hooves, A noticeable swayback, chubby build. Sir Reginald pushes Bumble from behind, trying to help him up the hill. Bumble puffs and pants. in Medieval Kingdom Countryside, on a small hill.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":6,"text":"At the top, they saw a grumpy gnome. He had the Singing Flower! He didn't want to give it up. \"It's mine!\" he grumbled. The flower was glowing a soft, golden color. It looked very pretty.","illustrationPrompt":"Sir Reginald and Bumble stand before a grumpy gnome. The gnome is holding a glowing flower. He has a long beard and a pointed hat. They are in a small clearing in the woods. Soft, magical colors. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772633730140,"durationMs":8025,"retries":0,"promptLength":1551,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A Young adult, early 20s with fair skin with a light blush on his cheeks, with short sandy blonde hair in short and neatly combed, slightly messy from his helmet, average bright blue eyes with hopeful, surprised expression, wearing Shiny silver armor with a red cross emblem on his chest. He wears a blue tunic underneath his armor. His helmet has a small red feather on top., with Silver sword with a jeweled hilt and Brown leather belt, Slightly buck teeth, Freckles across his nose, A small scratch on his left cheek, Dimples when he smiles. A medium light grey fur with a darker grey mane and tail donkey, small dark brown eyes with tired, curious expression, wearing Simple brown saddle and bridle., with None, Large, floppy ears, A small patch of white fur on his forehead, Slightly overgrown hooves, A noticeable swayback, chubby build. A small tan skin with a wrinkled face magical creature, small yellowish-green eyes with grumpy, possessive expression, wearing Dark green tunic with brown patches, a tall pointed red hat, and brown leather boots., with None, A large, bulbous nose, Bushy eyebrows that almost cover his eyes, Missing a tooth in the front, A small, pointed chin, stocky build. Sir Reginald and Bumble see a grumpy gnome holding a glowing flower at the top of the hill. in Medieval Kingdom Countryside, at the top of a small hill.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":7,"text":"Sir Reginald tried to be brave. \"Please, give us the flower,\" he said. \"It will make everyone happy!\" The gnome just shook his head. Bumble sighed loudly. He was still tired.","